.el .ds Aq '
.TH rqx-waive 1  "waive " 
.SH NAME
rqx\-waive \- Waive one finding with a comment in the source, and the reason a reviewer reads
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrqx waive\fR [\fB\-\-until\fR] [\fB\-\-whole\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-tui\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-mouse\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-motion\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-progress\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-reason\fR> <\fIFILE:LINE\fR> <\fIRULE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Waive one finding with a comment in the source, and the reason a reviewer reads
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-reason\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Why the finding stands. A waiver without one is not honoured
.TP
\fB\-\-until\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
The waiver stops being honoured after this date
.TP
\fB\-\-whole\-file\fR
Waive the rule for the whole file, not the line
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print the diff the waiver would make and change nothing
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Read settings from this file, layered over any `rqx.yaml` found
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-tui\fR
Never open the interactive interface; bare `rqx` prints the report instead
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-mouse\fR
Leave the mouse to the terminal. The session never captures it; the flag is still accepted so an existing invocation keeps working
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR [default: auto]
When to colour output; `auto` follows NO_COLOR and whether stdout is a terminal
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-motion\fR \fI<MOTION>\fR [default: on]
Animation in the interactive interface
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on
.IP \(bu 2
off
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-progress\fR
Do not draw the progress bar on stderr; `\-\-quiet` implies it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE:LINE\fR>
Where the finding is, as FILE:LINE; FILE alone with \-\-whole\-file
.TP
<\fIRULE\fR>
The rule to waive, as `rqx rules` lists it
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  rqx waive src/api.ts:42 unused\-export \-\-reason "called from the plugin host"
  rqx waive src/api.ts:42 unused\-export \-\-reason kept \-\-until 2027\-03\-01
  rqx waive src/gen.ts unused\-export \-\-reason generated \-\-whole\-file
  rqx waive src/api.ts:42 unused\-export \-\-reason kept \-\-dry\-run
